31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Listen up! I know who the werewolf is. It's Midori!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold claim so early, Takumi. Are you certain?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What? Takumi, why would you say that? I would never hurt anyone!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"This is sudden. Takumi, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"If he is the Seer, the game ends now. But if he's lying, he's the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I am the Seer! I checked Midori last night and she's the wolf!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Midori has always seemed so gentle. It is hard to believe, but the truth is often hidden.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm a villager! Please, don't believe him! He's trying to frame me!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, what do you think? Is it more likely Takumi is the Seer or the wolf?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Statistically, a werewolf might claim Seer to eliminate a threat. However, Takumi's aggression is consistent.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not lying! Midori, stop acting! Just admit it!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us listen to Midori's defense. @Midori, do you have anything to say?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm just a normal person! I don't have any special powers! Please, look at how scared I am!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Her reaction is emotional, which could be genuine or a performance.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I find Takumi's certainty more reliable than Midori's plea.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Vote for Midori! Let's end this right now!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"If Takumi is indeed the Seer, we must follow his lead for the village.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,Please... don't do this...,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll trust the Seer's claim for now.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The most logical path is to trust the divination.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
